REM shell_whoami.duck [SKETCHY-LOOKING, HARMLESS] - opens a REAL terminal and
REM runs READ-ONLY commands that just PRINT info (who you are, the hostname, the
REM Windows version). It changes nothing, downloads nothing, deletes nothing.
REM This is the "yes, it can reach a shell" demo. Windows (Win+R cmd).
DELAY 800
GUI r
DELAY 600
STRINGLN cmd
DELAY 1400
DEFAULTDELAY 15
STRINGLN whoami
STRINGLN hostname
STRINGLN ver
STRINGLN echo (those were read-only - nothing was changed)
